- REVIEW: `TASK-260728-1yhuqi` changes requested and routed to `analysis`. Independent cycle-3 replay is green: 23/23 cases, 32 closure checks with no verdict, 14/14 expected-red controls (also replayed individually), 56/56 structural checks, and executed P2 admission.
